      "n": "#387·31",
      "text": "A grey ribbed knit two-piece suit featuring a relaxed, drop-shoulder top with long sleeves and a matching midi skirt that falls just below the knee. The skirt includes a side slit for ease of movement, and the set is designed to be worn together as one cohesive piece."
    },
    {
      "n": "#299·02",
      "text": "A structured orange leather crossbody bag with a pebble texture, silver hardware detailing on the flap closure and chain strap. It has a rectangular shape with a subtle fold-over front detail and a decorative tassel hanging from the side."
    },
    {
      "n": "#423·15",
      "text": "An elegant ivory pearl necklace featuring a central pendant of a crystal-encrusted bow, from which a single pearl dangles. The necklace is designed as a two-layer piece, with the shorter layer resting at the collarbone and the longer chain draping down to the mid-chest."
    },
    {
      "n": "#9·10",
      "text": "Burgundy suede loafers with a thick black rubber platform sole and a block heel. The shoe features a distinctive metallic strap across the vamp adorned with four small crystal studs, adding an edgy detail to the classic loafer silhouette."
    }
  ]
